This product consumes, as pinned git dependencies, software developed by others. None of
it is vendored in this repository: `lake` fetches each dependency at the revision pinned
in lakefile.toml.

* mathlib4 — the Lean mathematical library
  https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4
  Apache License 2.0

* Lean-QEC — end-to-end formalization of quantum error correction
  upstream: https://github.com/VerifiedQC/Lean-QEC
  v4.34 port consumed here: https://github.com/QCL-SUAT/Lean-QEC
  Apache License 2.0 (the upstream distribution carries its own NOTICE)

* QECLean — a Lean 4 formalization of quantum error correction, consumed here for the
  Gross-formula machinery behind the BB144 distance lower bound
  https://github.com/QCL-SUAT/QECLean
  Apache License 2.0
